  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Spell - Riptide" id="8f7e-a461-a88b-93a4" hidden="false">
      <description>Target an enemy model even if it is Engaged. The model is moved 3” (as directly and as far as possible) away from the caster, making Armour rolls if forced to Break Away as normal. The model must  then make a Nerve test. If it fails, it is Knocked-down. Models with Steady may roll to avoid this as normal.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Spell - Crushing Pressure" id="7a97-4229-8776-c990" hidden="false">
      <description>If the target suffers any wounds, they are pinned in place and cannot make any Walk or Run actions for the rest of this Round.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="RISING TIDES (1)" id="fd9f-cfe1-fed3-435a" hidden="false">
      <description>Use this ability when you activate a model. That model may EITHER add 2 to its Sp stat until the end of the Round OR, if it is Knocked-down, it may stand up for free. This ability may be used any number of times in a Round.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Vicious Swipe" id="22b8-f8ac-e757-9f41" hidden="false">
      <description>When attempting to Break Away from a Giga, enemy models have a  -1 modifier when they make their Armour roll.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="BOUNDER (1)" id="e92a-80d0-8e3e-ba30" hidden="false">
      <description>Use this ability when this model is activated. Grants this model the Fly ability until the end of the Round.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="EVASION (1)" id="f14f-1146-9788-eac7" hidden="false">
      <description>Use this ability when this model activates. Grants this model the Dodge and Parry abilities until the end of the Round.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Equipment - Trident" id="424e-7d48-2087-3f92" hidden="false">
      <description>A model hit with this weapon in Melee, is marked as Fatigued.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Equipment - Net" id="85c4-9aa4-c6ee-5a59" hidden="false">
      <description>Break away actions from this model are made rolling 2 dice for the Armour roll rather than the normal 1. Each failed roll causes a wound.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="BATTLE RAGE (2)" id="e956-4817-e249-a976" hidden="false">
      <description>If this model can Engage an enemy model with a follow-up move, it may Engage that model and initiate another Melee by using the ability to go into a Battle Rage. This model will not get any bonus dice for charging however. Once this second Melee has been resolved, mark this model as Fatigued.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Combined Fire" id="9572-126b-ed39-c8f9" hidden="false">
      <description>When involved in a Group Shoot Action, Riverguard models add +1 dice to their Ranged Attack roll if one or more other Riverguard models in the group fire at the same target. This includes any Riverguard Sentinels in the Group.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Kyron&apos;s Blessing" id="1fdb-8a87-696f-1b9a" hidden="false">
      <description>While within 6&quot; of  one or more friendly Water Elementals, this model has its Ar value improved by 1 (e.g. 6+ becomes 5+).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Elemental  Mastery" id="5909-b9c3-50ca-6819" hidden="false">
      <description>You may take one additional Water Elemental in your warband beyond the limit for Large models normally allowed in the warband selection rules. 
In addition, this model may cast its Riptide spell as a short action instead of the normal long action.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Death from Above" id="cc6a-f638-8528-fe79" hidden="false">
      <description>When this model uses its BOUNDER special ability and then performs a qualifying charge action in the same Round, it has Crushing Strength (2) in its subsequent
Melee attack. Use this ability before any attack dice are rolled.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Defensive Toxins" id="f2b2-cbe4-1910-bb06" hidden="false">
      <description>In the End Phase, any enemy models Engaged by the Dambuster automatically suffer one hit with Crushing Strength (2).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="TONGUE LASH (2)" id="9422-4d23-502f-c924" hidden="false">
      <description>Use during the model’s Turn to make a Ranged attack as follows: Range 9”, 2D8. Any model hit by the attack is not wounded but is moved directly (the shortest route) into base contact with the Dambuster’s
front arc and marked as Fatigued. The model’s front arc and base should be flush with the Dambuster’s. Models that were Knocked-down remain so. If it is not possible to move the model, or it is Large, the attack has no effect.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Fluid Defense" id="4353-28e2-7b1f-9084" hidden="false">
      <description>While within 2&quot; of this model, friendly WARRIOR models have the Parry special rule.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="SLAMBACK (1)" id="9be6-0f68-1b99-9a02" hidden="false">
      <description>Use this ability when this model declares a Retaliation before dice are rolled. Any hits the Retaliation scores are resolved with Crushing Strength (2).</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Kraken&apos;s Call" id="0dbc-a8d5-6085-2386" hidden="false">
      <description>While within 6&quot; of this model, friendly models have the Unbreakable  and Bloodlust special rules.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Very Inspiring (Riverguard (all types) only)" id="2f13-440c-deae-0811" hidden="false" page="39" publicationId="37f5-f8f9-pubN68000">
      <description/>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry name="Crushing Pressure (long)" id="3e97-62a4-37d3-7986" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name=" Points" typeId="b888-e3bd-8798-6364" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink name="Rule Check - Is Faction Spell" id="af9a-86e0-a700-f9e2" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" targetId="8264-6e8e-3e44-c2c9" type="selectionEntry"/>
      </entryLinks>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Spell - Crushing Pressure" id="46b4-049f-f76d-3eda" hidden="false" targetId="7a97-4229-8776-c990" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
